WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:10.400
In a project, go down to its tasks

2
00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:13.900
Tap the circle to move it along

3
00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:16.400
In Progress — tap again when it's done

4
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:20.000
Or open a task…

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.600
…tap Edit…

6
00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:27.100
…pick a priority…

7
00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:30.600
…and a status

8
00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:34.100
Blocked, say

9
00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:37.600
Save

10
00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:42.900
Add Heading groups a project's tasks

11
00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:48.200
Name it

12
00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:51.800
Add

13
00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:55.300
Touch and hold a task…

14
00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:58.800
…Move to Heading…

15
00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:02.300
…Launch week

16
00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:06.000
Down to the heading…

17
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:15.500
…the task sits under it now
